1
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:10,116
Briefing for ministers and cabinet. Your signature is not free.

2
00:00:13,216 --> 00:00:16,843
Minister Kerbu: Today we sign for one hundred megawatts of power for our people!

3
00:00:17,143 --> 00:00:25,825
A public signing, especially with a head of state, creates a political commitment that is harder to withdraw than any clause in the document.

4
00:00:27,275 --> 00:00:36,576
At signature, government gets a visible response to power shortages, at almost no cost. The cost comes later, and it is paid by someone else.

5
00:00:39,326 --> 00:00:53,278
Exit one: it stalls. Nigeria signed fourteen solar PPAs in 2016. Four years later, a headline read: eleven hundred and twenty-five megawatts promised, not one electron delivered.

6
00:00:56,528 --> 00:01:09,307
Exit two: it closes on weak terms. In Ghana, after forty-three noncompetitive PPAs, net sector arrears stood at two point seven five billion dollars in 2019.

7
00:01:12,357 --> 00:01:18,074
Decision note. Before the ceremony: who will carry the risk, and have they tested the deal?

8
00:01:18,974 --> 00:01:23,113
The utility and the treasury are usually absent at signature.

9
00:01:23,563 --> 00:01:26,208
The lenders arrive years later.

10
00:01:26,658 --> 00:01:29,880
And an indicative tariff becomes the reference point.

11
00:01:30,330 --> 00:01:49,210
Your decisions. Publish a register of power MoUs, and let lapsed options expire. Allow no MoU outside the least-cost plan unless it has been tested against it. And let Finance and the utility review any MoU that could lead to fixed payments or state support, before signature.

12
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,443
Stop.

13
00:01:52,943 --> 00:01:54,500
You chair the cabinet.

14
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,456
A signing is scheduled for Friday, before the cameras.

15
00:01:58,856 --> 00:02:01,267
Finance has not seen the MoU.

16
00:02:01,667 --> 00:02:04,696
The project is not in the least-cost plan.

17
00:02:05,096 --> 00:02:06,397
What do you decide?

18
00:02:13,597 --> 00:02:17,971
Momentum is the trap. Test the deal before the cameras arrive.

19
00:02:20,021 --> 00:02:22,197
Your signature is not free.

20
00:02:23,097 --> 00:02:26,574
Bring the risk bearers into the room, before the cameras.
